  triage:title "warn_emit_fallback accepts &'static str instead of DaemonSubsystem" ;
  triage:description "daemon_runtime_observability.rs warn_emit_fallback signature used subsystem: &'static str. Sprint AC requires typed subsystem/action identifiers from a shared enum/newtype. Fix: change parameter to accept DaemonSubsystem (or &DaemonSubsystem) and call .as_str() internally. Update call sites in runtime_health.rs from literal 'daemon_runtime' to DaemonSubsystem::RuntimeHealth.as_str()." ;
